# Untracked working files, which the handoff and doc-review skills and ad hoc reviews write to the
# repository root. They are scratch rather than documentation, and a local `markdownlint --fix` run
# would otherwise rewrite them.
#
# The leading slash anchors each pattern to the repository root, so only the working files there are
# skipped. Matching is case-insensitive, so without it a tracked file elsewhere whose name ends the
# same way would be skipped too.
/*DOC-REVIEW.md
/*-REVIEW*.md
/*HANDOFF.md
/*PLAN.md
/*local-review*.md
